# Environment Variables

This file lists all environment variables required by the project. A copy of this is also located in `backend/.env.example`.

```env
# Application Settings
APP_NAME=DeepFake ForensicAI
APP_VERSION=1.0.0
HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=8000
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173

# Upload & Storage Settings
MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE_MB=500
UPLOAD_DIR=data/uploads
CASE_DIR=data/cases
REPORT_DIR=data/reports
MODEL_DIR=data/models

# Inference Settings
DEVICE=auto

# External APIs
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# IBM Bob Settings (located in backend/app/bob/config.py)
# IBM_BOB_API_KEY="PASTE_YOUR_IBM_BOB_API_KEY_HERE"
```
